{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 Ways to 7 is a Craps-Inspired roguelike dice builder all about smart getting and huge stacks of chips.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005440/extras/7f1b1187b56d362937662b5579e3a4ef.avif?t=1774826158\" width=576 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using over 100 unique Special Chips, bend the rules of the table in your favor! Enhance your personal betting style with a handcrafted build, as you unlock harder difficulties and more powerful items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005440/extras/8110cdd89069ac4f0303ddf60905c011.poster.avif?t=1774826158\" width=1170 height=1108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005440/extras/8110cdd89069ac4f0303ddf60905c011.webm?t=1774826158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005440/extras/8110cdd89069ac4f0303ddf60905c011.mp4?t=1774826158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only Craps roguelike on the market</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create endless builds - Each item shifts the odds in your favor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 7 increasing difficulty tables to test your skills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005440/extras/426a720cb44c6a